  "bio": "\"Iki Petattooart, nestled in the heart of Alcalá de Henares, Spain, offers a unique and intimate tattooing experience, specializing in the bold and vibrant 'trashpolka' style. With a cozy, family-like atmosphere, our skilled artists are adept at bringing to life personalized designs, with an expert mastery in black and grey realism, catering to all stylistic preferences. Transform your vision into ink with us at Iki Petattooart, where creativity meets precision.\"\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Alcalá De Henares, Community Of Madrid, Spain"
